# Chantivo Dedicated Server reverse-proxy example: TLS termination + WebSocket passthrough only.
# Copy to an ignored runtime Caddyfile, set CHANTIVO_PUBLIC_HOSTNAME (real public DNS name), and
# run Caddy on the same host as (or with network access to) the Chantivo Dedicated Server. See
# README.md in this directory for what this does and does not cover, and its real preconditions.

{$CHANTIVO_PUBLIC_HOSTNAME} {
    reverse_proxy 127.0.0.1:8090
}
